    feat(mcp): expose the data plane — declared-table CRUD, declare, search, query (SURFACE-MCP-DATA-001)
    
    MCP reached only memory primitives. The table verbs move out of the Express
    handlers into src/tables/operations.ts and the declare core into
    src/tables/declare.ts; REST and MCP are now thin adapters over the same
    functions. New tools: tables_declare, table_list, table_insert, table_select,
    table_update, table_delete, search (keywordSearch), query (readOnlyQuery).
    
    Grants follow the REST order (namespace scope, then per-table read/write; SQL
    policy for query) and refusals reuse the REST message/code and audit reason
    (table_grant). Proof: scripts/proofs + docs/evidence, both transports, live
    scratch daemon; suite 258 files / 2148 tests green.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
